Package: sparseAdaptiveGRF
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Adaptive Geographically Weighted Random Forest for Annual NPP
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Tao20210321", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tao20210321@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fits a sparse adaptive geographically weighted random forest
    without materialising an N by N distance matrix. The package provides
    synchronized NPP-centred cleaning, VIF filtering, random-forest recursive
    feature elimination or importance ranking, annual model fitting, and
    raster-to-data-frame prediction for user-supplied environmental rasters.
